<div class="py-4">
    <div class="page-title" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Report / Register a Child</div>
    <p class="text-muted" style="margin-bottom: 28px;">Choose one simple public form. No login is required.</p>

    <div class="row g-3">
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="h5">Report Abandoned Child</h2>
                    <p>Send the child location, estimated age, gender, description, and an optional image.</p>
                    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/public/report"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i> Report child</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="h5">Request Child Admission</h2>
                    <p>Ask the orphanage to review a child admission request with a supporting document.</p>
                    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/public/admission"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-circle-plus"></i> Request admission</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
